# ── Browser-automation artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────
# Written by Playwright/MCP while verifying the UI against live pages.
# Throwaway: console logs, accessibility snapshots, and screenshots.
# Screenshots land in the repo root; anything committed lives in a subdirectory.
# A name-prefix list kept missing new ones (myinfo-verified.png slipped past
# widget-*/popup-*/page-*), so ignore root-level PNGs wholesale — icons/ and any
# other real assets are in subdirectories and unaffected.
.playwright-mcp/
/*.png
*-snapshot.yml

# ── Packaged builds ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# chrome://extensions "Pack extension" output. The repo is the source of
# truth; load it unpacked.
*.crx
*.pem
*.zip

# ── Not used by this project, but cheap insurance ────────────────────
# There is no build step and no npm dependency. If either ever appears,
# keep it out of the repo.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Editors / OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
